Still: default to the Ink Margin layout and grayscale tab contents.

Keep Helium's existing vertical/Zen controls, observe a profile preference on
browser-owned WebContents layers, and expose page color through a hover/focus
footer toggle. No changes to renderer security, compositing, or overlay code.
The toggle is currently exposed in Vertical layout only; the saved preference
continues to apply when using another layout.

